    "m2_prompt_trader_proposal_original": "**Action**: Hold\n\n**Reasoning**: The evidence is genuinely balanced at $174.42. The bull case is anchored in verified FY2023 fundamentals ($84.95B operating cash flow, $201.88B equity) and a firmly bullish long-term trend (price 21.9% above the rising 200-day SMA). However, the bear correctly flags deteriorating near-term momentum \u2014 MACD down 47% from its February peak, price below the 10-day EMA/VWMA on nearly double average volume, and a bearish divergence on the March 14 high \u2014 plus the absence of any income statement data to verify valuation. With symmetric risk-reward (3.5% to upper Bollinger vs. 3.6% to lower band) and no catalyst forcing immediate entry, neither a Buy at this price nor a Sell against the strong primary uptrend is warranted. Maintain current exposure at benchmark weight and act on the defined two-sided triggers: add on a reclaim of $175.40 on strong volume, or on a test of the $168\u2013$165.60 support zone that holds.\n\n**Entry Price**: 174.42\n\n**Stop Loss**: 165.61\n\n**Position Sizing**: Maintain current exposure at roughly benchmark weight; do not add until either the $175.40 upside trigger or the $168\u2013$165.60 downside support test is confirmed.\n\nFINAL TRANSACTION PROPOSAL: **HOLD**",
